  "faqs": {
    "eyebrow": "FAQs",
    "title": "Answers, before you ask",
    "description": "The questions brands ask most often about our transport and warehousing network - what we move, where we move it, and how you keep sight of it.",
    "items": [
      {
        "q": "What logistics services does Ripplr offer?",
        "a": "Intracity and intercity movement (surface and air), warehousing, a distribution management system, and tech-enabled solutions including vehicle tracking, GPS, intelligent sensors and cold chain support."
      },
      {
        "q": "Where does Ripplr operate?",
        "a": "Across 15+ cities in India - Bengaluru, Mumbai, Delhi, Hyderabad, Panjim, Pune, Chennai and more - supported by a network of micro-warehouses and hubs, with headquarters in Bengaluru."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can Ripplr handle temperature-sensitive shipments?",
        "a": "Yes. Cold chain solutions with intelligent sensor monitoring and product quality assurance are part of the standard offering - which is why brands in dairy, meat and seafood, and perishables use the network."
      },
      {
        "q": "How do brands track their shipments and orders?",
        "a": "Through Ripplr's platform. A master dashboard provides live tracking, alert monitoring, fleet data and invoice generation, while driver and supervisor apps handle delivery confirmation and payment collection with a full activity history. Sales information is shared with manufacturers in real time."
      },
      {
        "q": "Which industries does Ripplr support?",
        "a": "FMCG (core), dairy, meat and seafood, perishables, white goods and e-commerce - with tailored solutions across refrigeration, warehousing, logistics and analytics."
      }
    ]
  },
